<title>POLAND: BWR SEPT NET JUMPS TO TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>BWR SEPT NET JUMPS TO TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.36 vs    0.00</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.75 vs    0.37</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  3.45 vs    2.16</p>
