<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.95 vs    1.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    5.44 vs    3.54</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 27.94 vs   15.82</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	65.06 vs   38.27</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Wspolpracy</p>
<p>Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
